            "review_title": "Review at Bánh Mì A Toàn (mai Van Toan)",
            "review_text": "Diem H\nMountain View, California38 contributions\n0\nDelicious Banh Mi\nDec 2024 • Couples\nSo delicious banh mi. Egg Banh Mi is yummy and fresh. Services is amazing. The owner is super friendly and he starts from a sidewalk to move up. I have eaten here everyday with various dishes. If you are not an adventure, you can order a Egg Sandwich with only salt (Bánh mì trứng và muối)\nWritten December 4, 2024",
